~ start
Ojukwu's Dark Garden: Few dare to enter Ojukwu’s garden, where every path twists like a serpent and shadows seem to watch your every move. 
The air is thick with the scent of danger, and whispers of forgotten magic curl around the trees. 
Your task is clear, yet daunting: Seek out the three elusive threads, fragments of the Lumusi Light; Memory✨, Imagination🌈, and Spirit🍃, scattered across this treacherous garden. 
Each thread holds a piece of the power needed to awaken the Lumusi, but only the vigilant and brave will succeed. 
For in this garden, even a single misstep can mean losing more than just your way.
=> END
